  m_text: 'RADAR - STATION 4


    OPERATOR NOTE:

    A valid missile track appears
    on

    THREE consecutive sweeps, travels

    INWARD, and stays STEADY (no wobble).


    Tune
    the knobs to isolate that

    track, then pull LOCK TARGET.'
